        "id": 1361259
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-06-15T18:42:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It might also work to only check whether the timer expired after polling the remaining time:\n\n```\nif (k_timer_remaining_ticks(...) \u003d\u003d 0 \u0026\u0026 k_timer_status_get(...) \u003d\u003d 0) {\n    // Timer was not started\n} else {\n    // Timer expired\n}\n```\n\nhowever I\u0027m not certain that `k_timer_remaining_ticks` always returns nonzero on timers that have yet to expire.",
      "parentUuid": "2b8391d5_63546ee5",
      "revId": "a80fcf9a366699261d55a8c54edc8dad131826bd",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
